<title>USA: Helen Hunt wins Emmy for best actress in a comedy.</title>
<headline>Helen Hunt wins Emmy for best actress in a comedy.</headline>
<dateline>PASADENA, Calif. 1996-09-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Helen Hunt, star of the NBC show &quot;Mad About You&quot;, won the Emmy Award on Sunday for best actress in a comedy series.</p>
</text>
